OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start in the south and
OL,6,Fwest with a chance of light rain for a
OL,7,Ftime, clearing later. Otherwise, a
OL,8,Fbright, but rather breezy day.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FLargely dry with clear spells
OL,12,Fdeveloping. Turning chilly with some
OL,13,Fmist or fog patches possible and a
OL,14,Ftouch of frost in prone rural spots.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FAny early mist or fog
OL,17,Fclearing, then a mostly dry and bright
OL,18,Fday with sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
